## Overview

Phase 7 implements the final two game segments: Spin the Wheel and Showcase Showdown.

Players who won bidding rounds compete in a wheel-spinning game to determine the two finalists, who then face off in a showcase showdown bidding on high-value product packages.

### Spin the Wheel Summary

- Wheel with 20 segments containing values from $.05 to $1.00 in $.05 increments
- Players spin by clicking the wheel itself (animated 3-second spin)
- Up to 2 spins per player (optional second spin with "Stay" or "Spin Again" choice)
- Player closest to $1.00 without going over wins
- Players over $1.00 are eliminated
- Tie-breaker spin-offs with single spins until winner determined
- Two wheel rounds: after first bidding set and after second bidding set

### Showcase Showdown Summary

- Two finalists (winners from both wheel rounds)
- Player who won higher-value bidding product goes first
- Each finalist views their showcase package (multiple products)
- Finalists choose to bid or pass to opponent
- Closest bid without going over wins
- Within $250 of actual price wins both showcases
- Retry mechanism if both bids are over

